@InfraMapper_HostAddress = http://localhost:5166
@subscriptionId = your-subscription-guid
@resourceGroup = your-rg-name

GET {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Slim graph: nodes (id, name, type, location, resourceGroup) + edges only
GET {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/api/infra/graph?subscriptionId={{subscriptionId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Full inventory: nodes with tags, properties, sku, kind + edges (large payload)
GET {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/api/infra?subscriptionId={{subscriptionId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Create approval (manifest must match apply body exactly)
POST {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/api/infra/approvals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subscriptionId": "{{subscriptionId}}",
  "resourceGroupName": "{{resourceGroup}}",
  "deploymentName": "sample-infra",
  "templateJson": "{\"$schema\":\"https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentTemplate.json#\",\"contentVersion\":\"1.0.0.0\",\"resources\":[]}",
  "parametersJson": null,
  "mode": "Incremental",
  "waitForCompletion": true,
  "location": null
}

###

### Apply deployment (paste approvalId from previous response)
POST {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/api/infra/deployments/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvalId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "subscriptionId": "{{subscriptionId}}",
  "resourceGroupName": "{{resourceGroup}}",
  "deploymentName": "sample-infra",
  "templateJson": "{\"$schema\":\"https://schema.management.azure.com/schemas/2019-04-01/deploymentTemplate.json#\",\"contentVersion\":\"1.0.0.0\",\"resources\":[]}",
  "parametersJson": null,
  "mode": "Incremental",
  "waitForCompletion": true,
  "location": null
}

###

### Deployment status (no approval)
GET {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/api/infra/deployments/sample-infra/status?subscriptionId={{subscriptionId}}&resourceGroupName={{resourceGroup}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Generic resource: create approval (example tag update — use a real resource id)
POST {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/api/infra/resource-approvals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/resourceGroups/{{resourceGroup}}/providers/Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/youraccount",
  "operation": "CreateOrUpdate",
  "location": "eastus",
  "propertiesJson": "{\"supportsHttpsTrafficOnly\":true}",
  "tags": { "env": "dev" },
  "skuJson": null,
  "kind": null,
  "waitForCompletion": true
}

###

### Generic resource: apply (paste approvalId; body must match approval exactly)
POST {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/api/infra/resources/apply
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "approvalId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "resourceId": "/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/resourceGroups/{{resourceGroup}}/providers/Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/youraccount",
  "operation": "CreateOrUpdate",
  "location": "eastus",
  "propertiesJson": "{\"supportsHttpsTrafficOnly\":true}",
  "tags": { "env": "dev" },
  "skuJson": null,
  "kind": null,
  "waitForCompletion": true
}

###

### Generic resource: delete approval
POST {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/api/infra/resource-approvals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resourceId": "/subscriptions/{{subscriptionId}}/resourceGroups/{{resourceGroup}}/providers/Microsoft.Storage/storageAccounts/youraccount",
  "operation": "Delete",
  "location": null,
  "propertiesJson": null,
  "tags": null,
  "skuJson": null,
  "kind": null,
  "waitForCompletion": true
}

###

### Generic resource: GET by id (no approval; URL-encode id in clients)
GET {{InfraMapper_HostAddress}}/api/infra/resources?id=https%3A%2F%2Fexample.invalid%2Fuse-real-encoded-id
Accept: application/json

###
